mixin faqItem(question, answer)
    .card.card-white.js-toggle.card-normal.card-grouped.card-shadow(data-target="", data-collapse=".js-collapse")&attributes(attributes)
        div
            .card__header.justify-content-between.align-items-center
                h3.h6.card__title.m-0= question
                .card__btn.btn.btn-secondary.btn-small.magnet-btn
                    span.btn-icon
                        svg.icon.in-active-none(width="16" height="16")
                            use(href="#plus")
                        svg.icon.in-inactive-none(width="16" height="16")
                            use(href="#minus")
                    span.sr-only Перемкнути відповідь
            .card__body.js-collapse.lh-0
                p.card__text= answer
